  "description": "[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13706425) \n\nBaek Isaac is a popular YouTuber with 1 million subscribers. Just as he’s riding high on his wholesome public image, a devastating whistleblowing scandal erupts.\n\nThe incident escalates due to anti-fans' sensationalism, and the worst-case scenario unfolds as rumors of him being an exploitative employer spread, making it nearly impossible to hire a replacement. Amidst this, one person catches Isaac’s eye: Song Yudam, his longtime fan and an editor at a publishing house.\n\n“I want you to be my partner. I need a trustworthy employee to help me. No matter how much I think about it, you are the only one who can replace PD Park.”",
